   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"5\" type=\"1\">\n    <li>The moth population over 10 weeks is graphed below. <br> <img src=\"exercises/media/66f1987900df82e6.jpg\" width=\"350\" alt=\"A line graph titled 'Moth Population (Thousands)' vs 'Time Since Measured (Weeks)' shows an exponential decay. The population starts at 500,000 moths at week 0, rapidly decreases, and levels off near 5,000 by week 10.\">       \n</li>\n  </ol><ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\">\n        <li>After 4 weeks, the population was 40 thousand. What was the average rate of change from the start to the 4th week?</li>\n      </ol>",
   "answers": [],
